Cash Register was added in '''Beta 36.0''' with the Magic ability to choose a Turbo monster in your hand, return it to the top of your deck and drawing a card. This will make you draw the card you've just chosen, so this Magic basically retriggers the Turbo effect. '''Beta 49.1''' changed it so it does that right away.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP: 4

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Magic: Topdeck a Turbo monster in your hand. Draw a card. (Post Beta 36.0)
* Magic: Choose a Turbo monster in your hand. Trigger its Turbo. (Post Beta 49.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
